  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rohingya Response and National Resilience Programme (RRNRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Members (NRC, DRC &amp; HI) hereby agree to enter into a Consortium. The main purpose of the consortium is to promote and enhance collaboration amongst its Members in order to deliver more effective and timely multi-sector humanitarian assistance to the Rohingya refugees and most vulnerable host communities in Bangladesh. The consortium will bring together three of the largest INGOs currently operating in the country in order to strengthen the protection mechanisms available to the target group as well the advocacy and lobbying efforts with the government of Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
